@title Controller: several instances as tabs, pop-out panels and shared-target lines
@area Live
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Shift+L, "Controller..." opens the card; the fixture has one radio. "Duplicate" makes a second
# instance (tab "Generic radio 2 copy"), "Pop out" gives the selected one a panel of its own, and the
# first tab stays in the card. Both can be operated at once.
open qa/fixtures/radio-hoist.novo
wait 20
key shift+l
wait 20
click_text "Controller…"
wait 20
expect "+ Add"
expect "Duplicate"
shot one-tab
check_layout
click_text Duplicate
wait 10
expect "copy"
shot two-tabs
click_text "Pop out"
wait 20
expect "Keyboard here"
shot popped
check_layout
click_text "Name, colour and group"
wait 10
shot settings
check_layout
